WEBVTT

00:14:28.747 --> 00:14:31.025
where it feels
like you're just on a treadmill.

00:14:31.049 --> 00:14:33.159
(Music)

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:34.986
So tell me this.

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:40.136
There are days in my job
where I feel like I have too much to do,

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:43.046
and there are a lot of people
depending on me,

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:48.776
and I can't respond to all of them
as fast as I would like.

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:54.336
And I keep just plowing through emails
to try to get to inbox zero.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.510
Am I burned out?

00:14:56.689 --> 00:14:58.146
AHP: I mean, that, I think,

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:01.042
is a great example
of what you would call stress.